        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "LEONARD WILSON KEENAN ESTATE & LETTING AGENTS\r\n\r\nOur business is you....\r\n\r\n2 BED / 1 BATH HOME FLOODED WITH NATURAL LIGHT\r\nSMALL INTIMATE DEVELOPMENT OF HOMES\r\nMOST SOUGHT AFTER LOCATION\r\n\r\nEARLY VIEWING STRONGLY ADVISED\r\n\r\nA lovely home in an amazing location….\r\n\r\nMulti Award Winning Team Patrick Leonard The Drumcondra Property Specialists are truly delighted to present this lovely home to the Dublin 9 property market.\r\n\r\nNo. 20 will impress first time buyers, , investors and parties trading down alike.\r\n\r\nGriffith Hall is a most sought after address adjacent to a wealth of local amenities to include Drumcondra & Fairview Villages.\r\n\r\nThe spacious floor plan of No. 20 consists of: Entrance hall, store room, living / dining / kitchen, 2 bedrooms and family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe features of this home include: Modern fitted kitchen with an abundance of base and eye level storage to include all appliances\r\n& main bathroom with white sanitary ware.\r\n\r\nThe property also boasts double glazed windows.\r\n\r\nThere is a balcony off the living room with a most enviable aspect overlooking the beautiful grounds.\r\n\r\nThe property comes with one designated parking space.\r\n\r\nThe area is serviced by an excellent bus route making the city most accessible.\r\n\r\nThere are a wealth of amenities on your doorstep to include: Shops, parks, church, recreational facilities and sports clubs.\r\n\r\nThe property also falls into an excellent catchment of both primary and secondary schools.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is strongly advised.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
